## Website security contract

Keep the generated `create_agent_website_app` boundary in place for private
agent data and controls. Its backend rejects protected API requests with 401
until the assigned per-agent TOTP profile succeeds, then falls back to the
shared pairing TOTP when no profile is assigned. Its frontend hides and marks
the entire protected shell inert while locked. An OTP dialog or backdrop alone
is not a security boundary: do not render private data, controls, or an
interactive background underneath it.
